// Behavioral tests for the REAL generated Authorizer (PC-W-1): they mint real
// JWTs, sign them with a generated Ed25519 key, seed the matching JWK, and drive
// Authorize/AuthenticateAtOrBelow over the actual verify path — signature,
// audience, expiry, unknown-kid, tamper, S2S auth_services, C2S entitlements
// presence, and the namespace level-or-below rule. No fake auth funcs.

